Preamble  
The Contracting Parties,  
Recognizing the need for a high level of protection of human life during the loading, unloading, stowage and transport of containers;  
Noting the necessity of facilitating international container transport;  
Acknowledging that the establishment of common international safety requirements would be beneficial in this regard;  
Considering that the best means of achieving these objectives would be to conclude a convention;  
Resolve to establish formal requirements regarding container structural integrity to ensure the safety of loading, stacking and transport operations in normal service.

During the visit, the two sides signed the following agreements:  
1. *Agreement Between the Government of the People’s Republic of China and the Government of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan on Expanding and Deepening Bilateral Economic and Trade Cooperation*;  
2. *Framework Agreement on Cooperation Between the Ministry of National Defense of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of National Defense of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
3. *Framework Agreement on Cooperation in the Energy Sector Between the National Development and Reform Commission of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Resources of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
4. *Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation in Vocational Training Between the Ministry of Labour and Social Security of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Labour, Human Resource and Overseas Pakistanis of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
5. *Memorandum of Understanding Between the Ministry of Transport of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Transport of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan on the Rehabilitation of the Karakoram Highway*;  
6. *Memorandum of Understanding on Fisheries Cooperation Between the Ministry of Agriculture of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Food, Agriculture and Livestock of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
7. *Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation in Pesticide Management Between the Ministry of Agriculture of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Food, Agriculture and Livestock of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
8. *Memorandum of Understanding Between the Ministry of Commerce of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Commerce of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan on Initiating Joint Research for a Five-Year Plan on Bilateral Economic and Trade Cooperation*;  
9. *Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation in the Health Sector Between the Ministry of Health of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Health of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
10. *Memorandum on Cooperation Between the National Population and Family Planning Commission of the People’s Republic of China and the Ministry of Population Welfare of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*;  
11. *Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation in Seismic Research Between the China Earthquake Administration and the Pakistan Meteorological Department*;  
12. *Memorandum of Understanding on Meteorological Science and Technology Cooperation Between the China Meteorological Administration and the Pakistan Meteorological Department*;  
13. *Master Agreement Between China Exim Bank and the Ministry of Economic Affairs and Statistics of Pakistan on Providing a $300 Million Preferential Export Buyer’s Credit from the Government of the People’s Republic of China to the Government of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan*.
